  "title": "CHAPTER 5: ANUVAD (TRANSLATION :अनुवाद)",
  "order": 5,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "14ttzxm",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5.1 Definition and Importance of Translation"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Understanding the definition and importance of translation (Anuvad) is foundational for official government communication.",
        "Official translation requires strict adherence to key principles to ensure clarity, accuracy, and official validity.",
        "Knowledge of specialized institutions dedicated to Hindi translation supports standardized usage in governance.",
        "Mastery of English to Hindi terminology in Banking and Administrative contexts is essential for competitive exam scoring."
      ],
      "id": "vcatxsy"
    },
