    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "sz38p1p",
      "content": "Translation (Anuvad) is the process of transferring meaning from one language (source language) to another (target language) while maintaining the original meaning, tone, context, and purpose. For Rajbhasha Adhikari, translation is primarily from English to Hindi :translating official orders, circulars, correspondence, notices, forms, and banking documents."
    },
    {
      "id": "96654ig",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Type of Translation</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Hindi Term</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Description</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Examples</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Literal / Word-for-Word Translation</p>",
            "<p>शाब्दिक अनुवाद</p>",
            "<p>Translate each word directly; mechanical; often unnatural; useful for technical/legal documents where precision required</p>",
            "<p>Legal sections, technical standards where word precision critical</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Free Translation</p>",
            "<p>स्वतंत्र अनुवाद / भावानुवाद</p>",
            "<p>Translate meaning and spirit; not word-for-word; natural target language output; reader-friendly</p>",
            "<p>Speeches, creative content, general correspondence</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Literary Translation</p>",
            "<p>साहित्यिक अनुवाद</p>",
            "<p>Translate literature (poetry, novels, plays); capture tone, style, cultural nuances</p>",
            "<p>Translating Hindi poetry to English; translating novels</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Official/Administrative Translation</p>",
            "<p>आधिकारिक अनुवाद</p>",
            "<p>Government orders, notifications, rules, circulars, official correspondence; accuracy paramount</p>",
            "<p>Acts of Parliament translated to Hindi; bank circulars; RBI guidelines</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Interpretation (Oral)</p>",
            "<p>दुभाषिया / भाषान्तरण</p>",
            "<p>Real-time oral translation; simultaneous or consecutive; parliamentary debates, high-level meetings</p>",
            "<p>Parliamentary interpreters; international conference translators</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Machine Translation (MT)</p>",
            "<p>मशीनी अनुवाद</p>",
            "<p>Automated software translation; GIST (C-DAC), Google Translate, deepL; needs post-editing for official use</p>",
            "<p>Anuvadini (C-DAC), Sangyan system; used for volume translation</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "oriu7pp",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5.2 Translation :Key Principles for Official Work"
    },
    {
      "id": "4igcml1",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "Faithfulness (Faithfulness to meaning): The translation must accurately convey the meaning of the original; no omission or addition",
        "Idiomacity: Use natural idiomatic Hindi expressions; avoid 'Hindi-English' hybrid writing",
        "Clarity: The translated text must be clear and unambiguous to the reader",
        "Appropriate register: Official documents need formal Hindi (शिष्ट हिंदी); avoid colloquial forms",
        "Technical terminology: Use approved technical terms from Paribhashik Shabdavali (terminology lists) prepared by CSTT",
        "Cultural sensitivity: Avoid awkward cultural impositions; find natural Hindi equivalents",
        "Consistency: Use same term for same concept throughout a document; maintain consistency in long documents"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "x2f25x6",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5.3 Important Institutions for Hindi Translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "muftgqz",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Institution</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Hindi Name</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Role</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Central Hindi Directorate (CHD)</p>",
            "<p>केन्द्रीय हिंदी निदेशालय</p>",
            "<p>Under Ministry of Education; promotes Hindi; prepares grammar, dictionaries, textbooks; grants for Hindi authors and publications</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Central Translation Bureau (CTB)</p>",
            "<p>केन्द्रीय अनुवाद ब्यूरो</p>",
            "<p>Under DoOL, MHA; translates Acts, Rules, forms, and other official documents from English to Hindi; provides translation assistance to Ministries</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Commission for Scientific and Technical Terminology (CSTT)</p>",
            "<p>वैज्ञानिक तथा तकनीकी शब्दावली आयोग</p>",
            "<p>Develops technical vocabulary (paribhashik shabdavali) for Hindi in all subjects; prepares bilingual technical dictionaries</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>C-DAC (Gist group)</p>",
            "<p>C-DAC GIST</p>",
            "<p>Develops Hindi computing tools; Mangal Unicode font; Anuvadini machine translation; IndiX search; ISM software for Devanagari typing</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>National Translation Mission (NTM)</p>",
            "<p>राष्ट्रीय अनुवाद मिशन</p>",
            "<p>Under Central Hindi Directorate; translates important Indian and foreign texts into all 22 scheduled languages; major translation project</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Sahitya Akademi</p>",
            "<p>साहित्य अकादमी</p>",
            "<p>India's national academy of letters; promotes Indian literature; annual Sahitya Akademi Awards; translation prizes</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
